  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CPG/8688/2022 - British Embassy Muscat: Oman Economic Programme (OEP)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting economic reform efforts in Oman this programme seeks to embed specialist advisors/consultants into key ministries in order to improve capacity and capabilities within government to enact reform. This tender seeks to continue this technical assistance and will run from November 2022 to March 2025 to provide specialised, timely, demand-driven technical assistance in line with HMG priorities. (FCDO August 2022, Statement of Requirements ITT 5204)</narrative>
  </description>
